{"cluster_id": "C-1461", "topic": "2026-06-22 model currency audit found no old-design cruft in any live TLA+ model", "target": "architecture/design-history", "member_ids": ["AUDIT-M2-011"], "canonical_claim": "A 2026-06-22 model currency audit found no old-design cruft in any live TLA+ model, but found three models stale against shipped code around the B171 precommit-reachability mechanism \u2014 `CaBuildWatermark.tla`, `CaBuildWatermarkNum.tla`, `CaResurrectLiveness.tla` \u2014 and documented dispositions (mark stale; repurpose the watermark floor lemma for precommit-ref reclaim liveness) rather than deleting the models, preserving proof history.", "issue_ids": [], "sources": ["docs/superpowers/cas/02-methodology.md#L342-L350"]}
